OL,3,AUS interest rates held steady and
OL,4,Aeconomy grows - what it means for you
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe US Federal Reserve has held
OL,7,Finterest rates steady at 3.75% - 4%.
OL,9,FThe decision comes within a week of the
OL,10,Fmidterm elections and after the central
OL,11,Fbank raised interest rates for the
OL,12,Ffirst time in three years at its
OL,13,FSeptember meeting.
OL,15,F"The overwhelming consensus, the
OL,16,Foverwhelming judgement, is that what
OL,17,Fwe've done in this monetary medicine is
OL,18,Fstarting to work some," Fed Chair Kevin
OL,19,FWarsh said, referring to September's
OL,20,Finterest rate rise.
OL,23,APub: 28-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  BusinessC Nat TVF  Nat News
FL,111,105,200,300,0,100
